# Sub-tick extent of the gem glint (tests/harness/check_feeder_subtick.sh --path
# glint-ext). Rows: <bk2> | <V> | rec=<addr> [rtol=] [step=]. rec is the pool
# record whose extent is judged, a near star (24 traced corners).
#
# sunrise-spring-surface-swim.bk2 1482, rec 8006DF48: canon1480 3.961 px,
# canon1482 4.784 px. Before the replay scaled the extent the alpha-0.5 ratio
# read 1.00 SNAP with own 0.822 (the whole step); with the scale 0.17 LERPED,
# own 0.143. Bound rtol=0.25, the LERPED boundary.
sunrise-spring-surface-swim.bk2 | 1482 | rec=8006DF48 rtol=0.25 step=0.5
